# Development scratch files.
# Probes, frame dumpers, PNG/string diff helpers and stale copies of real tools
# were being written to the repo root and to tools/ during development. They are
# never needed to play the game or to run a test suite.
.tmp-*

# Generated images from the offline renderers.
# tools/render-frame.mjs writes tools/frame.png (that is `npm run preview`) and
# every debug screenshot uses the frame* prefix; tools/render-alignment.mjs
# writes tools/hud-alignment.svg.
tools/frame*.png
tools/hud-alignment.svg

# Node. Nothing depends on it today (the game has zero dependencies), but
# `npm install` will create it.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Logs. No .log file is committed; this is cheap insurance.
*.log

# OS and editor junk.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Temporary files and coverage output.
*.tmp
coverage/
.nyc_output/
